{"unit_id":"wangzhanchao883__dsh-resume-screening#feature-1","repo":"wangzhanchao883/dsh-resume-screening","commit":"75c71966ba71d5429724cbaabd1713689de169ac","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-resume-screening 的功能「批量导入与去重」：递归扫描指定文件夹中的 DOCX、PDF、Excel、Markdown 或文本简历，并按内容哈希跳过已入库文件。调用 resume_ingest，输出新增、重复与跳过数量。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:142-172"]}
{"unit_id":"wangzhanchao883__dsh-resume-screening#feature-2","repo":"wangzhanchao883/dsh-resume-screening","commit":"75c71966ba71d5429724cbaabd1713689de169ac","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-resume-screening 的功能「格式转换与结构化建档」：将支持的 Word、PDF、Excel、Markdown 和文本内容转为统一文本，再抽取硬字段与标签并归档。通过 resume_process 批量处理待办简历。","source":"generated","evidence":["convert.mjs:10-25","extract.mjs:23-92","index.mjs:174-195"]}
{"unit_id":"wangzhanchao883__dsh-resume-screening#feature-3","repo":"wangzhanchao883/dsh-resume-screening","commit":"75c71966ba71d5429724cbaabd1713689de169ac","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-resume-screening 的功能「岗位条件规则筛选」：对保存的岗位条件执行必选标签过滤，并按命中的加分条件及权重排序。调用 resume_screen，可指定返回数量。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:231-285","scoring.mjs:113-165"]}
{"unit_id":"wangzhanchao883__dsh-resume-screening#feature-4","repo":"wangzhanchao883/dsh-resume-screening","commit":"75c71966ba71d5429724cbaabd1713689de169ac","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-resume-screening 的功能「候选人 LLM 精判」：在规则筛选后可选择对入围者逐份读取归档正文并调用 DSH LLM，生成评分、结论和理由。调用 resume_screen 并设置 llm=true。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:264-274","judge.mjs:31-68"]}
{"unit_id":"wangzhanchao883__dsh-resume-screening#feature-5","repo":"wangzhanchao883/dsh-resume-screening","commit":"75c71966ba71d5429724cbaabd1713689de169ac","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-resume-screening 的功能「结果导出与索引重建」：调用 resume_export 将筛选结果写成 CSV；调用 resume_rebuild 从 Markdown 归档重建 SQLite 索引。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:306-365"]}
{"unit_id":"wangzhanchao883__dsh-resume-screening#caveat-1","repo":"wangzhanchao883/dsh-resume-screening","commit":"75c71966ba71d5429724cbaabd1713689de169ac","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-resume-screening 使用前须知：LLM 精判仅在设置 llm=true 时调用 DSH 的 ctx.llm.stream；该通道不可用时会提示并可改用规则筛选（index.mjs:264-269）。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:264-269"]}
